pulse: defaults, one pulse, no fall, negative delay
model vsource vsource
v1 (a 0) vsource type="pulse"
v2 (b 0) vsource type="pulse" val0=0 val1=1 rise=1u fall=1u width=1u period=0
v3 (c 0) vsource type="pulse" val0=0 val1=1 rise=1u fall=-1 width=1u period=4u
v4 (d 0) vsource type="pulse" val0=0 val1=1 delay=-1u rise=2u fall=1u width=1u
v5 (e 0) vsource type="pulse" dc=7 val0=2 val1=3
control
  options rawfile="ascii"
  analysis op1 op
  analysis tr1 tran stop=10u step=1n maxstep=5n
endc
